# The up-to-two search may choose one basic land even when more eligible cards are available (CR 701.23b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Myriad Landscape
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Island x4
Forest x6
Plains x4
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Myriad Landscape.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Myriad Landscape.Activate(Ability: {2}, {T}, Sacrifice this land)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Search(Forest)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Myriad Landscape
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Tapped = true
